<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Jarrod Scherer's personal website, projects, and hobbies."
		/>
		<title>Jarrod Scherer</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<header>
				<div>
					<h1>Jarrod Scherer</h1>
					<p>
						A home for my programming projects and Warhammer hobby.
					</p>
					<a href="https://github.com/jazztothetwo" target="_blank"
						>Find me on GitHub</a
					>
				</div>
				<img
					class="avatar"
					src="https://images.jarrodscherer.au/personal/avatar_resized.png"
					alt="My online avatar: a crowned dragon with blue fur and rainbow markings."
					width="512"
					height="512"
				/>
			</header>

			<section>
				<h2>About</h2>
				<p>
					I'm a university student nearing the end of my computer
					science degree, an avid Warhammer collector, and a hobbyist
					programmer.
				</p>
			</section>
			<div class="content-grid">
				<section>
					<h2>Projects</h2>
					<p>
						Right now, my GitHub mostly houses my university
						projects and reports.
					</p>
					<p>
						One project that might interest you is <a
							href="https://github.com/jazztothetwo/fly-discourse"
							target="_blank">Fly Discourse</a
						>: I exposed a fruit fly connectome to 50,000 furry
						discourse posts until it developed opinions. Underneath
						the joke, it's an experiment passing text embeddings
						through a simulated neural network based on a fly's
						wiring, then training a classifier on the resulting
						activity.
					</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2>
						<a href="https://warhammer.jarrodscherer.au"
							>Warhammer</a
						>
					</h2>
					<p>
						I mainly collect Space Marines in two flavours: a
						sizeable 40k Dark Angels force and an even larger 30k
						Sons of Horus force, approaching 15,000 points. I also
						dabble in Imperial Guard, specifically Krieg, and have
						the customary pile of shame.
					</p>
					<p>
						My blog follows my personal journey and experiences in
						the hobby.
					</p>
				</section>
			</div>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>

